  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SBDP 2024-2028: Green growth, business enabling environment &amp; Jobs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Somalia Green Growth Programme&#x2019;s Objective is to increase private investment into commercial green growth investments. In turn, this will contribute to the objectives of Somalia&#x2019;s National Climate Policy and National Action Plan. In parallel, there is an objective to enable DFIs in general and IFDK in particular to be able to work in Somalia and other super-fragile states.</narrative>
  </description>
